न वाला – </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">Resembling or characteristic of a boy.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">Example: \"His boyish charm made him very likable.\"</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\">Stiff</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;– </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">कठोर – </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">Rigid or not easily bent.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">Example: \"The old book had stiff, yellowed pages.\"</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\">Moist</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;– </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">नम – </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">Slightly wet or damp.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">Example: \"The air was moist after the rain.\"</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\">Mature</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;– </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">परिपक्व – </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">Fully developed physically or mentally.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">Example: \"She handled the situation in a mature manner.\"</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000; font-weight: bold;\">Conclusion:</span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 13.5pt; color: #000000;\">\"Mature\" is the best antonym for \"young\" because it signifies full development, whereas \"young\" implies an early or undeveloped stage. The other options do not convey the opposite meaning effectively.</span></p>",
